  aciklama:
  - "At\u0131na g\xFCle g\xFCle de {{isim}}! <sprite=0>"
  - "Bakal\u0131m bu at olmadan ne yapacaks\u0131n... <sprite=0>"
  - "At\u0131n\u0131 ald\u0131m! Az kald\u0131, \u015Fah\u0131n\u0131 da alaca\u011F\u0131m...
    <sprite=7>"
  - "Bu at\u0131 bana vermeyecektin!"
  - "Atlara pek \xF6nem vermiyorsun san\u0131r\u0131m {{isim}}..."
  - "Hoop, at\u0131n bende!"
  - "At\u0131n art\u0131k benim!"
  - "\u015Eu at\u0131 da yiyeliiim..."
  - "At\u0131n\u0131 merak edersen; az \xF6nce yedim! <sprite=0>"
  - "Pes et, bo\u015Fver, at gitsin; s\u0131k\u0131nt\u0131n\u0131 derdini at gitsin!...
    <sprite=20>"
  - "At\u0131 yanl\u0131\u015F zamanda kaybettin bence {{isim}}."
  - "Art\u0131k o at benim."
